title: Conceptual Spaces (CSP)
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

I tried to understand mathematical and scientific documents. 
The project pdfdrill and all its cousins are spin-offs from my research related to "Conceptual Spaces (CSP)".
On a daily basis ([[code4AI|https://www.youtube.com/@code4AI]]) I see publications related to improvement of memory and geometric structure of the latent space. A CSP (see [[Gärdenfors|https://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262572194/conceptual-spaces/]]) is positioned on the opposite site, instead of having very large number of dimensions it has only those dimensions needed to describe an object in the most concise form. 

